<title>USA: DCX names Stephen Carreker CEO/president.</title>
<headline>DCX names Stephen Carreker CEO/president.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKTOWN, Colo. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DCX Inc said it named Stephen Carreker president and chief executive to replace Jeanne Anderson, who will become chairman.</p>
<p>The moves are effective January 1, the company said.</p>
<p>Carreker, 47, has been a director of DCX since December 1995.</p>
<p>As chairman, Anderson will not be involved in the day-to-day operation of the company, the company said.</p>
</text>
